{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13215290","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13215290","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1321529001:0":{"text":"멜리사, 무덤 안 상황은 어때요? 유물이 많이 남아 있나요?","source_cn":"梅丽莎，墓穴里的情况还好吗？留下的文物多吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06E560C6D1FD9BB1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321529002:0":{"text":"아니요... 전혀요! 무덤 안에 있는 것들을 싹 다 털어갔어요...!","source_cn":"不好……一点也不好！墓穴里的东西都被盗墓贼抢劫一空了……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F675433F2ACC1ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321529003:0":{"text":"돈 좀 벌겠다고 이렇게 귀중한 유적을 끔찍하게 망가뜨리다니, 정말 너무한 거 아닌가요?!","source_cn":"为了赚钱，居然将珍贵的遗迹破坏成现在这副惨烈的模样……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE8CD1259E068A21","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321529004:0":{"text":"하, 이건 정말 말도 안 되는 일이야...","source_cn":"唉，谁说不是呢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B4D6F9C25AD30CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321529005:0":{"text":"그래도 완전 헛수고는 아니었잖아.","source_cn":"所幸这一趟也不算是完全没有收获。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC109A4C4CE135E3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female"